  "downloads": 6187,
  "description": "<p>simple texture pack for Weapon Camo And Stickers by 7bpencil for personal use, thought i would share as i know a couple people like what i made</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/Z4cidkc\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Images</a></p>\n<p>(i would like to embed pics but idk how)</p>\n<p>adds:</p>\n<p><strong>CAMOS</strong>—————————––</p>\n<p>-ERDL Woodland\n-Kryptek Raid\n-Kryptek Transitional\n-Multicam Black\n-100+ Camos from CODMW19</p>\n<p><strong>MASKS</strong>—————————––</p>\n<p>-Modular camo layers for custom variations\n-Airmesh\n-Dirt, drops and dust\n-Disc (for overwriting glass on scopes being textured for exemple)</p>\n<p><strong>STICKERS</strong>—————————––</p>\n<p>––Sharpie and markers for calibers like</p>\n<p>-300blk\n-556\n-223\n-6.5\n-6.8\n-308\n-300wm</p>\n<p>––Various Armory markings</p>\n<p>––Various Notes like</p>\n<p>-“handguard is bent”\n-“return to owner when done”\n-“trouble feeding”\n-“fix stock for next use”</p>\n<p>-Faction names\n-Arrows\n-Simple geometric markers</p>\n<p>––Simple Stickers</p>\n<p>-MW2009 WA2K Smiley sticker\n-MW2009 WA2K Smiley sticker clean\n-Ducttape\n-Schmidt &amp; Bender 308. Ballistic notes on paper</p>\n",
